{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDI0L0JhZCUyMFJpdmVyJTIwJTI4MjAyNCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Bad River","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jiwUCFIkZal0p8h7jzQbPRrB7wp.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/febWZ5wgQYI3gshA1uzhPKtu5gg.jpg","description":"Wisconsin's tribe's ongoing fight to protect Lake Superior for future generations. \"Bad River\" shows the Bad River Band of Lake Superior Chippewa's long history of activism and resistance in the context of continuing legal battles with Enbridge Energy over its Line 5 oil pipeline. The Line 5 pipeline has been operating on 12 miles of the Bad River Band's land with expired easements for more than a decade. The Band and the Canadian company have been locked in a legal battle over the pipeline since 2019.","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.8","runtime":"98 min","cast":["Edward Norton","Quannah Chasinghorse","Nate Ante","Kris Arbuckle","Kathy Bender Ashmun","Joe Bates","Rae Bender","Tyler Bender"],"director":["Mary Mazzio"],"released":"2024-03-15T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"A Story of Defiance.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Edward Norton","character":"Self - Narrator (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8nytsqL59SFJTVYVrN72k6qkGgJ.jpg"},{"name":"Quannah Chasinghorse","character":"Self - Narrator (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/krL1D5hM0Bio1M4oaI0qS12DrlS.jpg"},{"name":"Nate Ante","character":"Self"},{"name":"Kris Arbuckle","character":"Self"},{"name":"Kathy Bender Ashmun","character":"Self"},{"name":"Joe Bates","character":"Self"},{"name":"Rae Bender","character":"Self"},{"name":"Tyler Bender","character":"Self"},{"name":"Mike Berlin","character":"Self"},{"name":"Brad Bigboy","character":"Self"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"5tPJklYBKxQ","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer","ytId":"5tPJklYBKxQ"}]}}